# 5.1 Delegating to bundled specialists
# Beats: a plain-language ask, Atomic decides to delegate, the scoped children
# stream their progress into the conversation and return cited findings.
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "atomic"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Set TypingSpeed 28ms
Type "Map the validate/fetchUser flow in src-client.ts with focused subagents before we change it."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 95s
